{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10138280","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138280","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1013828001:1":{"text":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I intend to send Lucius back first to report the situation.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5B0968B14E89DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I intend to send Lucius back first to report the situation.","female":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I intend to send Lucius back first to report the situation.","variant_male_record_index":"114857","variant_female_record_index":"114858","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013828002:1":{"text":"The Temple needs immediate information in order to make timely decisions, I'm going to escort the acolytes.","source_cn":"圣堂需要第一时间的情报，才能及时作出判断。我打算护送这...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB7B60177C90220","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Temple needs immediate information in order to make timely decisions, I'm going to escort the acolytes.","female":"The Temple needs immediate information in order to make timely decisions, I'm going to escort the acolytes.","variant_male_record_index":"114859","variant_female_record_index":"114860","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013828003:1":{"text":"They'll rest a bit before we set off. They aren't skilled in combat, and the Hypofiends along the way may be dangerous.","source_cn":"待他们稍加休整后再启程，他们不擅长武力，一路上的魔物将...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x37F184C155CBFA80","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"They'll rest a bit before we set off. They aren't skilled in combat, and the Hypofiends along the way may be dangerous.","female":"They'll rest a bit before we set off. They aren't skilled in combat, and the Hypofiends along the way may be dangerous.","variant_male_record_index":"114861","variant_female_record_index":"114862","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013828004:0":{"text":"Protecting those who need protection—rather than indulging in self-serving penance, that is what I should be doing.","source_cn":"守护需要守护的人——比起自我满足的赎罪，这才是我应该做的事。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53FD19A67D4319FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Protecting those who need protection—rather than indulging in self-serving penance, that is what I should be doing.","female":"Protecting those who need protection—rather than indulging in self-serving penance, that is what I should be doing.","variant_male_record_index":"114863","variant_female_record_index":"114864","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013828005:0":{"text":"If you ever need my strength to fight against Hypogeans in the future, I am at your disposal.","source_cn":"如果您今后对抗恶魔时需要我的力量，特弥希娅随时供您召唤。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF39DC91C30D51444","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If you ever need my strength to fight against Hypogeans in the future, I am at your disposal.","female":"If you ever need my strength to fight against Hypogeans in the future, I am at your disposal.","variant_male_record_index":"114865","variant_female_record_index":"114866","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013828006:1":{"text":"Oh! I'll go with you!","source_cn":"哦哦！也带上我一个！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50A6962B46B8EBAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh! I'll go with you!","female":"Oh! I'll go with you!","variant_male_record_index":"114867","variant_female_record_index":"114868","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1013828006":{"text":"Oh! I'll go with you!","source_cn":"哦哦！也带上我一个！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50A6962B46B8EBAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh! I'll go with you!","female":"Oh! I'll go with you!","variant_male_record_index":"114867","variant_female_record_index":"114868","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013828007:2":{"text":"May Dura bless you, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"愿艾雅保佑您，<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD8871871835C46","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"May Dura bless you, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"May Dura bless you, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"114869","variant_female_record_index":"114870","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013828008:2":{"text":"And Atalanta...","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒，还有你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55DF8BBCB972E555","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013828009:2":{"text":"Don't bother, the petty goddess won't bless me... I've said plenty of bad things about her.","source_cn":"别，你们小心眼的女神是不会保佑我的。……我可没少说过她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F88C59EEDF0334A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013828010:1":{"text":"Dura is compassionate. But that wasn't what I was going to say.","source_cn":"艾雅是悲悯的。而且，我想说的不是这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34F562960BC79C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013828011:1":{"text":"Ata... would you want to travel alongside me?","source_cn":"阿塔……你是否愿意与我同行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209262C5DAD0D3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013828012:1":{"text":"It's been ages since we last met. I feel like... I've missed much of what's happened with you. I'd appreciate hearing about your experiences during these years—or anything, really...","source_cn":"我们太久没见了。我觉得……我错过了许多你的事情。我想听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4994674115BC8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1013828013:1":{"text":"... I get it. You're just looking for more help to protect these feeble acolytes on our journey, aren't you?","source_cn":"……切。我看，你只是想要多个帮手，帮你一路保护这些手无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B58C6090DFCDE51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1013828014:0":{"text":"*Chuckle* If that's how you want to put it.","source_cn":"嗯，随你怎么说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2BA2FC9B72DDA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1013828015:2":{"text":"Uh... Have you two patched things up? What happened? When did this happen?","source_cn":"呃……两位这是又和好了？怎么回事？是什么时候发生的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA294A0A17763472B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1013828016:2":{"text":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8BFE049FB95C811","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","female":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","variant_male_record_index":"114879","variant_female_record_index":"114880","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1013828016":{"text":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>大人，我错过了什么……吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8BFE049FB95C811","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","female":"Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, did I miss something...?","variant_male_record_index":"114879","variant_female_record_index":"114880","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1013828017:2":{"text":"You should go make your report to the general first! *Giggle* As for what happened, I'll tell you next time.","source_cn":"你还是先去汇报吧。至于发生了什么，下次见面我可以偷偷告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56BB78741CC98508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1013828018:2":{"text":"Really! Oh, Hammie, thank you! I'm going to leave right away, there's no time to lose!","source_cn":"真的吗！那漫漫小姐，多谢！事不宜迟，我出发了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEA6B2A20D276466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"None of your business.","source_cn":"人家的事你少管","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB7433A25E58139EE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"None of your business.","female":"None of your business.","variant_male_record_index":"62164","variant_female_record_index":"62165","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:1:2":{"text":"... You should head out, Lucius.","source_cn":"……你快走吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69BB975E77830FE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... You should head out, Lucius.","female":"... You should head out, Lucius.","variant_male_record_index":"62166","variant_female_record_index":"62167","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"